iphonebridge (0.20.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The per-app notifications setup and ancs-enable's advice turn on
    BlueZ's experimental interfaces with a systemd drop-in that runs
    bluetoothd with -E --noplugin=hfp; Experimental = true also turned on
    BlueZ's own Hands-Free client on BlueZ 5.86 and later, which left
    calls dead.
  * The deb install steps start the pairing on the iPhone.

